">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> trades</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Record</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (needsRebalance) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">asset</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">deviation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Object.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">entries</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(deviations)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">abs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(deviation) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.01</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        trades[asset] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">deviation;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { needsRebalance, deviations, trades };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>再平衡的实际效果是<strong>强制执行低买高卖</strong>。当股票大涨导致权益比例超标时，再平衡要求你卖出部分股票、买入债券；当股票大跌时则反向操作。这种逆人性的操作正是长期超额收益的重要来源。</p>\n<p>建议程序员采用&quot;季度检查 + 5% 阈值&quot;的混合策略：每季度检查一次组合比例，如果任何资产偏离目标超过 5 个百分点则执行再平衡。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((资产配置))&#10;    核心原理&#10;      决定90%+的收益&#10;      低相关性分散风险&#10;      纪律优于预测&#10;    经典模型&#10;      60/40 股债平衡&#10;      全天候策略&#10;      按风险偏好选择&#10;    生命周期&#10;      年轻多权益&#10;      年长多固收&#10;      100-年龄法则&#10;    再平衡&#10;      季度+5%阈值&#10;      强制低买高卖&#10;      纪律化执行\">mindmap\n  root((资产配置))\n    核心原理\n      决定90%+的收益\n      低相关性分散风险\n      纪律优于预测\n    经典模型\n      60/40 股债平衡\n      全天候策略\n      按风险偏好选择\n    生命周期\n      年轻多权益\n      年长多固收\n      100-年龄法则\n    再平衡\n      季度+5%阈值\n      强制低买高卖\n      纪律化执行</pre><ul>\n<li>资产配置决定投资组合 90% 以上的长期收益，比个股选择和择时更重要</li>\n<li>不同资产的低相关性是分散风险的核心，单类资产无论多优秀都不应独占组合</li>\n<li>经典的 60/40 股债配置适合大多数均衡型投资者，全天候策略适合稳健型</li>\n<li>资产配置应随年龄动态调整：年轻时权益为主，临近退休时固收为主</li>\n<li>程序员需额外考虑 RSU 集中风险和行业周期风险，投资配置中适当增加防御</li>\n<li>采用&quot;季度检查 + 5% 阈值&quot;再平衡策略，纪律化执行低买高卖</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"资产配置策略","id":"资产配置策略"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"经典配置模型","id":"经典配置模型"},{"level":2,"text":"生命周期配置调整","id":"生命周期配置调整"},{"level":2,"text":"再平衡策略","id":"再平衡策略"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"养老金账户体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/personal-finance/retirement-planning/retirement-accounts"},"next":{"title":"财务自由规划","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/personal-finance/retirement-planning/financial-independence"}}